<subpara id="RM000000MYT011X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000MYT011X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00001GS00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Navigation Antenna Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection (ETC Antenna)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122225J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The navigation antenna assembly is an integrated antenna combining the GPS antenna, VICS antenna and ETC antenna.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector shown in the illustration that is connected to the navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the core wire and shield terminals of the connector.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<table>
<title>Resistance:</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Core wire - Shield wire</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 Ω or less</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Assembly Installation Condition Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Inspect the navigation antenna assembly cord for installation problems such as sharp bends or pinching.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
